Four finishes.</p><p>Choose by workload and GPU capacity. Hardware is in development; specifications and quotes will be confirmed before ordering.</p></section><section class=\"kiln-one-collection\" aria-labelledby=\"hardware-one-title\"><div class=\"collection-one-intro\"><span class=\"meta\">1–2 GPUs / hardware ex VAT</span><h2 id=\"hardware-one-title\">Kiln One</h2><p>A dedicated workstation for local AI and focused creative work.</p><p class=\"product-price\">From £19,900</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one\">explore One <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"collection-one-finishes\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/pebble-grey-960.webp\" alt=\"Pebble grey Kiln One\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Pebble grey</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/baby-pink-960.webp\" alt=\"Baby pink Kiln One\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Baby pink</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/eucalyptus-960.webp\" alt=\"Eucalyptus Kiln One\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Eucalyptus</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/powder-blue-960.webp\" alt=\"Powder blue Kiln One\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Powder blue</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"section local software-pricing\" id=\"software-pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"software-pricing-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">managed KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">proposed plans / billed annually / ex VAT</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"software-pricing-title\">Priced for<br>your creators.</h2><p>Shared projects, approvals, qualified updates and standard support.</p></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">Kiln One</span><h3>£99<br>per creator / month</h3><p>10-creator minimum.<br><strong>£11,880 per year minimum.</strong></p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one#software-pricing\">explore the plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article></div><p class=\"service-boundary\">Review-only seats are free. Creation and agent actions require a paid creator seat. Hardware, cloud usage, custom integrations and enhanced service levels are additional. Licensed seat counts do not guarantee simultaneous workload capacity.</p></section><section class=\"section hardware-note\"><h2>Stay close.<br>See what’s next.</h2><p>Get product progress and launch details by email. No payment or commitment.</p><button class=\"action primary register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></section></main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"/#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><span class=\"kiln-wordmark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">kiln</span></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">about Kiln</a><a href=\"/#hardware\">the hardware</a><a href=\"/#questions\">questions</a><a href=\"/#privacy\">our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"/#top\">back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><h2 id=\"register-title\">Keep in<br>touch.</h2><p>Product news and launch updates.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-email\">email</label><input id=\"register-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-product\">interested in <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"register-product\" name=\"product\"><option>Still exploring</option><option>Kiln One</option><option>Media</option><option>Legal</option><option>Investor interest</option></select></div><label class=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required><span>Email me Kiln updates.</span></label><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-note\">Unsubscribe anytime. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy</a></p><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary\" type=\"submit\">keep me posted <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>You’re on the list.</h3><p>Thanks for following along.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></dialog>\n\n<dialog id=\"enquiry-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-title\" aria-describedby=\"contact-intro\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close contact\">×</button><h2 id=\"enquiry-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Let’s talk.</h2><p class=\"contact-intro\" id=\"contact-intro\">What are you working on?</p><form class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"contact\"><input id=\"enquiry-interest\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"reason\" value=\"General question\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"work-email\">your email</label><input id=\"work-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"workflow-message\">your message</label><textarea id=\"workflow-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"3000\" placeholder=\"A project, a question, an idea…\" required></textarea></div><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary contact-send\" type=\"submit\"><span data-submit-label>send message</span><span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p class=\"form-note\">Just a reply. No mailing list. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy</a></p></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>Message received.</h3><p>The Kiln team will follow up by email.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div><div class=\"contact-booking\"><span>Prefer a conversation?</span><a href=\"/book/\">book a call <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"compare-dialog\" class=\"compare-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close comparison\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">hardware / compare</span><h2 id=\"compare-title\">Find your fit.</h2><p>Proposed configurations. In development.</p><div class=\"compare-grid\"><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln One</h3><strong>From £19,900</strong><p class=\"fine\">1 GPU / ex VAT</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 6000 / 96 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable up to 2</dd><dt>Two-GPU configuration</dt><dd>£31,900 ex VAT</dd><dt>Upgrade when ordering</dt><dd>+£12,000 for a second GPU</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>128 GB / 4 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></dl></article></div><p class=\"fine\">All figures are engineering targets, subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; multiple cards do not automatically form one memory pool. Renders show hardware concepts.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to the hardware <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></dialog>\n",
